    {
      "id": "sol.amc-8-1998-p9.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "After the \\(20\\%\\) reduction, the price is \\(\\$10\\cdot 0.8=\\$8.\\)\n\nThen, after halving the price, the price is \\(\\dfrac{\\$8}{2}=\\$4.\\)\n\nThus, the correct answer is C .",
      "hints": [
        "A \\(20\\%\\) reduction leaves \\(80\\%.\\)",
        "The second reduction halves the reduced price."
